<h1>Ostyra Sync</h1>
<p>Ostyra Sync is a planning tool for distributed teams. The company was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in Ghent. The current release is v4.1.9.</p>
<p>Plans start at $24 per seat per month, billed annually. A single workspace supports up to 25 members, and every user gets 75 GB of storage. New accounts get a free trial of 30 days.</p>
<p>The public API allows 90 requests per minute per token. Human support is available Monday–Friday, 17:00–20:00 UTC.</p>
